# The runtime file set, the same one `make -C app release` stages and the shared app-release workflow ships
# (APS-Conecta/.github pack-app.sh reads this file in place of its defaults). appinfo, lib, templates, img,
# openapi, ops and the licences are sources; js/ and css/ are what the frontend build leaves behind.
# Development files — src, tests, tools, the configs, the Makefile, the Dockerfiles — stay out (issue 43).
+ /appinfo
+ /css
+ /img
+ /js
+ /lib
+ /openapi
+ /ops
+ /templates
+ /LICENSE
+ /THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md
- *.map
- /*
